{"OAuthLoginView uses pipeline.signature as the OAuth state value which is deterministic (hash of view class names), making it forgeable and not providing per-session CSRF protection for the OAuth callback": 0.688369631767273, "GitHubInstallation directly indexes integration.metadata['sender']['login'] which can raise KeyError and 500 the setup flow when a GitHub Integration exists without sender metadata": 0.9618818163871765, "OAuthLoginView calls safe_urlopen() to exchange the OAuth code without handling request/connection/SSL exceptions, so network failures can propagate as a 500 instead of returning the intended installation-failed UX": 0.9265360236167908}